silm:instances_papers_15_chapters_06_sections_03_concrete_anchor_3#eventtypetag silm:hasLongDescription "The EventTypeTag is the discriminator (vet-visit / microchip-read / dietary-card / weight-check). In the paper's apparatus it appears as the symbol 'event-type tag', a concrete instance grounded in the Mittens domain story; it serves as the anchor whose semantics every diagram, formula, and prose reference back to." .
